// The supported Expr construction helpers (include/sea/Expr/ExprOpBool.hh,
// boolop::land / lor / lneg / limp / lite): their local folds, the binary and
// range forms agreeing, empty ranges giving the identities. TypeChecker
// (include/sea/Expr/TypeChecker.hh): function / lambda application, nested
// binders, widths, the error result and its cache, a deep term. The checker
// prints nothing: stderr is empty.
RUN: sea-expr-api-test 2>%t.err | FileCheck %s
RUN: count 0 < %t.err
CHECK: test: bool-binary ok
CHECK: test: bool-range ok
CHECK: test: tc-functions ok
CHECK: test: tc-errors ok
CHECK: test: tc-deep ok
CHECK: failures: 0

